#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3748
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5567
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5580
